{
  "name": "突破上升通道",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [729, 730, 731],
  "source": "突破上升通道指股价先在由120日均线或60日均线作为下轨、代表性高点连线或斜上筷子线作为上轨的通道内运行；当股价在通道中被上下轨挤压后，向上突破上轨，往往意味着后续进入加速爬升阶段。",
  "source_summary": "若股价长期沿120日均线附近上行并最终突破近阶段通道高点，可视为突破上升通道成立。",
  "comment": "当前采用120日均线作为优先下轨、近阶段高点作为上轨的日线近似版。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["close", "low"],
  "warmup_bars": 180,
  "indicator_type": "breakout_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_base_window": 120,
    "slope_lookback": 10,
    "channel_lookback": 30,
    "setup_min_days": 10,
    "support_floor_ratio": 0.97,
    "signal_keep_days": 5
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_120",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_base_window",
      "description": "120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_120_ref",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "ma_120",
      "window": "$params.slope_lookback",
      "description": "向前平移后的120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_120_lower",
      "op": "mul",
      "field": "ma_120",
      "field2": "$params.support_floor_ratio",
      "window": 0,
      "description": "120日均线下方容差带"
    },
    {
      "id": "channel_high",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.channel_lookback",
      "description": "通道上轨的收盘近似"
    },
    {
      "id": "channel_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "channel_high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日通道上轨"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "breakout_channel",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "channel_high_prev",
      "description": "收盘突破上升通道上轨"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "ma_120",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "ma_120_ref"
          },
          {
            "op": "before",
            "condition": {
              "op": "and",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "close",
                  "operator": ">=",
                  "right": "ma_120"
                },
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "low",
                  "operator": ">=",
                  "right": "ma_120_lower"
                }
              ]
            },
            "event": "breakout_channel",
            "window": "$params.channel_lookback",
            "min_count": "$params.setup_min_days"
          },
          {
            "op": "condition",
            "event": "breakout_channel"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算120日均线，并要求其相对slope_lookback日前继续上行，以近似稳定的通道下轨。",
    "在channel_lookback窗口内要求价格多数时间站在120日均线附近且低点不明显跌穿下轨，近似‘通道内挤压运行’。",
    "当收盘价突破近阶段通道高点时，视为突破上升通道并进入加速上涨阶段。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以收盘突破通道上轨的当日作为突破上升通道确认日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文允许60日均线替代120日均线作为下轨，且上轨可取代表性高点连线或斜上筷子线，当前统一为120日均线 + 近阶段高点近似。",
    "原文还提到UP、UV洗盘可能出现在突破前，当前主规则未单独并入。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= ma_base_window + channel_lookback + 1。",
    "support_floor_ratio 用于表达120日均线下轨的容差带。"
  ],
  "explain": "突破上升通道被结构化为沿120日均线附近运行一段时间后，向上突破近阶段通道高点。"
}
